        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "You can pick the Assault Doctrine or the Tactical Doctrine one additional time per battle. Your MOUNTED/SPEEDER units get +1 to their Advance rolls. Your Suboden Khan units gain the Wrath of the First Khan ability, which lets you either make a Fall-Back move at the end of the Fight phase if engaged, or a Normal move if unengaged.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Evasive Manouvres (1CP)",
        "id": "dec7-0be8-a525-2a1d",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: In your opponent's Shooting phase, when they target a MOUNTED/SPEEDER unit with ranged attacks\nTARGET: A targeted MOUNTED/SPEEDER unit\nEFFECT: Ranged attacks get -1 to wound your unit for the rest of the phase.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Flawless Riders (1CP)",
        "id": "759b-3caa-ec7b-88f8",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: In your Movement or Charge phase\nTARGET: A MOUNTED unit\nEFFECT: Give a MOUNTED unit MOBILE for the duration of the phase.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Hunter's Instincts (1CP)",
        "id": "048c-bfc7-0b10-4a1f",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: In your opponent's Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of one of your INFANTRY, MOUNTED, or SPEEDER units\nTARGET: An INFANTRY, MOUNTED, or SPEEDER unit\nEFFECT: Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D3+3\".",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Mobile Lethality (1CP)",
        "id": "17d9-82e5-d40a-88e9",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: In your Movement phase, when one of your units makes an Advance or Fall Back move\nTARGET: A unit making an Advance or Fall Back move\nEFFECT: Your unit gains ASSAULT on its ranged weapons and is still eligible to shoot even after falling back.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "name": "Spear Thrust and Sabre Swing (1CP)",
        "id": "9be8-3c8f-7998-be18",
        "hidden": false,
        "typeId": "9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64",
        "typeName": "Abilities",
        "characteristics": [
         {
          "name": "Description",
          "$text": "WHEN: In the Fight phase when one of your units is selected to fight\nTARGET: A unit selected to fight\nEFFECT: Your unit gains [LETHAL HITS] or [LANCE] for the phase, unless the unit is MOUNTED, in which case it gains both.",
          "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
